  "description": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE - FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present to the rental market these two bedrooms / one-bathroom own door apartments ideally located at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains in the ever popular Deerpark Development.\r\n\r\nThe Deerpark development is always in high demand as it is within easy reach of all local amenities including shopping facilities like the Square Shopping Centre, a variety of bars & restaurants, an extensive choice of sports grounds & leisure facilities, and a great mix of primary & secondary schools. The area is well serviced with excellent bus routes and road networks. The Luas is also within striking distance. Bright and airy internal living accommodation spans to 62 sqm. Briefly comprises of extremely spacious dual aspect living area and kitchen, two double bedrooms, and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe living area provides access to the private south facing balcony. AVAILABLE NOW, and viewing highly advised!! Additional Features; - Parking included - 2 Bedroom / 1 Bathroom - Double glazed windows - Gas heating - Sunny private balcony - Within arm's reach of N7 and M50 Motorway - Within walking distance of the LUAS line - Plenty of bus routes on your doorstep - Highly sought-after development AVAILABLE NOW!!\r\n\r\n**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE - FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**",
